  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a 4IR digital development center in the industrial park of the Brest region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the Brest region, as a result of the implementation of the pilot project #Leveraging the potential of Fourth Industrial Revolution technologies for smart manufacturing and ISID in Belarus#, a regional pilot demonstration and innovation center was established, r ecommendations were elaborated for the development of the Brest regional innovation system (including the necessary business, scientific and innovation infrastructure) and the restructuring of higher education to train personnel for the Fourth Industrial Revolutio n.  Based on the successful results of the pilot project in the Brest region, it is proposed to continue cooperation in the development of an innovative system with a focus on the development of an industrial park in the city of Baranovichi. The development strategy for this industrial park provides establishment of a 4IR Digital Development Center.  The proposed project is intended to contribute to the efforts of the Government of the Republic of Belarus to further develop Industry 4.0 technologies in the Brest region. The project will strengthen the industrial development of the region, increase the competitiveness and potential of local companies and specialists, promote the implementation of digital technologies, and ensure the transfer of knowledge of the Fourth Industrial Revolution.</narrative>
  </description>
